---
/**
 * Spam honeypot. Real visitors never see or fill this field; bots that fill every
 * input do. Basin rejects submissions where `_botvortex` has a value, and the submit
 * handlers also drop them client-side.
 * Hidden off-screen (not display:none) so naive bots still treat it as a real field.
 */
---

<div
  aria-hidden="true"
  style="position:absolute;left:-10000px;top:auto;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;">
  <label>
    Leave this field empty
    <input type="text" name="_botvortex" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" value="" />
  </label>
</div>
